Christian Preuﬂ <c.preuss@tu-harburg.de> writes:

> While fighting Jubilex, he cursed my ring of levitation. When I got out of
> Ghennon, I tried to pray, but Tyr did not help me. What can I do to
> uncurse the ring?

To uncurse it, you could #dip it in holy water, if you have any, or in a
fountain, or read a non-cursed scroll of remove curse. (With a fountain
you may need several tries before it works, and the fountain may dry up
before that.) 

There are also ways to get it removed even without getting it uncursed
first: 
You may get a nymph to steal it (you probably want to remove all armor and
possible other ring and amulet and drop everything to make sure the cursed
ring will be what the nymph steals) or levitate over a sink.
If it is an engagement ring, a succubus or incubus (depending on your
character's gender) may also remove it.

And then there might be some way I don't remember right now..

